  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A synthetic glucocorticoid drug that is particularly effective as an immunosuppressant, and affects virtually all of the immune system. Prednisone is a prodrug that is converted by the liver into prednisolone (a \u03b2-hydroxy group instead of the oxo group at position 11), which is the active drug and also a steroid."
  ],
